</li><li>Customizable combat mech with varied weapon loadouts<br></li><li>Diverse and intelligent enemy AI requiring strategic gameplay<br></li><li>Detailed, atmospheric environments within the factory and the decimated city<br></li><li>Dynamic rock soundtrack amplifying the tension and adrenaline<br></li><li>Compelling narrative with unexpected twists and moral dilemmas<br></li><li>Challenging missions and intense boss battles against colossal robotic foes</li></ul>",
